# Example xbps repository snippet for a *public* Atelier repo (future).
# When you publish repo/out (or a subset) to a static HTTPS host, point here:
#
# repository=https://example.com/atelier/current
#
# Layout to publish (rsync/static host):
#   repo/out/*.xbps
#   repo/out/*-repodata
#   (optional) repo/out/*-repodata.sig  if you sign later
#
# Signing is optional for MVP. If you sign later:
#   - keep private keys OUT of git (see AGENTS.md / .gitignore)
#   - publish only the public key / signature metadata
#   - document key fingerprint for users
#
# This file is an example only — do not enable until a real URL exists.

# repository=https://example.com/atelier/current
